  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I want to download and interpret binary data, but I can't.\n\nRight now VRCStringDownloader supports strings, however data loss occurs with downloaded binary data due to the Unicode interpretation that VRC presents to UDON code.\n\nI would love to be able to iterate on a byte array from a downloaded file.",
